WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Love, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
I want to protect you with these hands

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Do you know real men?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
They're weak to the women they protect

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Is he sweeter than me?

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Is he stronger than me?

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
The night of the full moon is cold

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
My soul is supposed to be in my hands

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
My memories get moved to the shadows

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Love, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
I want to protect you with these hands

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
You taught me about women, love, and passion

00:01:30.891 --> 00:01:34.127
I'm Orphen, a black sorcerer
from the Tower of Fangs.

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:37.864
Five years ago, the magician
| looked up to, Azalie,

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:41.468
activated the Heavenly Beings'
Sword of Baltanders

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:44.671
and became the magical beast Bloody August.

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:48.108
After leaving the Tower of Fangs
in search of Azalie,

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:51.078
I, with my apprentice, Majic, and Cleao

00:01:51.078 --> 00:01:54.247
began a quest to restore Azalie
to her normal human state.

00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:56.883
Let's go Majic! Cleao!

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:58.218
To our next adventure!

00:01:58.218 --> 00:01:59.553
To the next town!

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:12.399
Maybe we shouldn't after all.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.670
What are you so afraid of, Dortin?

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:23.043
With a ruin this big, it's not bad karma
if we take a treasure or two!

00:02:23.043 --> 00:02:24.244
I think it is.

00:02:29.416 --> 00:02:30.817
See? It is.

00:02:31.852 --> 00:02:32.986
Ouch!

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.724
We hit it! It's a hit! It's a huge treasure!

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:40.961
My glorious eyes make no mistake!

00:02:40.961 --> 00:02:42.396
You did it, Big Brother!

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:47.134
What is this?

00:02:47.134 --> 00:02:49.136
Is it a broken doll?

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:51.238
You two.

00:02:52.973 --> 00:02:53.974
Sorcerers?

00:02:56.677 --> 00:02:58.879
Are you two sorcerers?

00:03:05.652 --> 00:03:08.321
That is a sorcerous runes sword.

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:11.491
Then I shall grant you death.

00:03:11.692 --> 00:03:14.061
| exist solely to execute my programming.

00:03:14.361 --> 00:03:16.296
Y-your wrong! This sword is...

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:18.098
Orphen! It's Orphen!

00:03:19.099 --> 00:03:20.000
Orphen?

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.637
A black sorcerer named Orphen
forced this sword upon us! Yes!

00:03:25.739 --> 00:03:28.442
A black sorcerer? Orphen, you say?

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:36.216
Partner I the
CIty Of canals

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:48.795
A city of water and people, rich with history,

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:52.833
the beautiful capital Alenhatan!

00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:55.635
The great capital of the continent Kielsalhima,

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:59.005
but half of its ruins are of
the Heavenly Beings,

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:02.809
so hordes of tourists with too much
time on their hands flock here.

00:04:04.144 --> 00:04:07.948
So many gargoyles!
It just looks like a city of ruins.

00:04:10.217 --> 00:04:10.917
Right?

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:13.720
Just like I said it'd be.
Isn't it good that we came here?

00:04:13.954 --> 00:04:17.858
Orphen, you are tired, so you have to relax
and breathe a little every once in a while.

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:20.660
You're always relaxing!

00:04:21.862 --> 00:04:23.730
You just want to play tourist, right?

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:27.400
What? You know, Orphen,
| was just thinking of you.

00:04:30.604 --> 00:04:32.606
This is so cute!

00:04:32.606 --> 00:04:36.009
If you like things like that,
get it at the store on the corner.

00:04:36.009 --> 00:04:38.211
It should be the cheapest one around here.

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:40.213
If you're persistent, they'll give you a deal.

00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:41.281
What?!

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:44.284
If you knew, then you should have
said something sooner!

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:49.356
| see! You say this and that,
but you're checking out the prices.

00:04:50.824 --> 00:04:52.225
It's not like that!

00:04:53.193 --> 00:04:56.163
I've been to this town before.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:57.931
To Alenhatan?

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:01.001
It was just for a little while though.

00:05:01.001 --> 00:05:03.236
This place hasn't changed at all.

00:05:03.236 --> 00:05:04.905
It's still the same as it was then.

00:05:06.173 --> 00:05:08.608
You should say stuff like that sooner, okay?

00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:10.677
Now, show me around!

00:05:10.677 --> 00:05:12.612
| want to go to this shop.

00:05:12.612 --> 00:05:14.347
See? This one. Here!

00:05:14.347 --> 00:05:15.215
Here...

00:05:15.682 --> 00:05:16.850
Orphen?

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:19.019
Save the touring for later.

00:05:19.019 --> 00:05:21.321
| have to find someone I knew before first.

00:05:21.721 --> 00:05:23.023
Someone you knew?

00:05:23.023 --> 00:05:25.192
W-wait, Orphen!

00:05:43.743 --> 00:05:45.879
"Finding lodging is part of your apprenticeship."

00:05:46.446 --> 00:05:49.216
Master sure makes everything go his way.

00:05:49.216 --> 00:05:51.151
Hey, Stephanie, hello there!

00:05:51.151 --> 00:05:52.085
Hello!

00:05:52.552 --> 00:05:54.487
Looking even more beautiful today!

00:05:54.487 --> 00:05:56.556
My flowers really appreciate the flattery.

00:06:10.036 --> 00:06:11.605
Watch out!
Get out of the way!

00:06:13.206 --> 00:06:16.009
That I call... That I... Tha...

00:06:30.991 --> 00:06:33.193
Thank you so much!

00:06:33.193 --> 00:06:34.561
It's all right now.

00:06:35.161 --> 00:06:36.930
Excuse me. Here...

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:38.565
Thank you.

00:06:38.899 --> 00:06:40.567
Are you all right?

00:06:40.901 --> 00:06:42.435
I'm all right.

00:06:42.435 --> 00:06:43.436
But...

00:06:43.436 --> 00:06:44.504
I'm fine.

00:06:44.504 --> 00:06:48.008
I'm sorry. All I could do was stand around.

00:06:48.608 --> 00:06:50.610
You're a sorcerer?

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:51.945
Yes, well...

00:06:51.945 --> 00:06:56.016
But my master says I'm quite a ways
from being a sorcerer.

00:06:56.716 --> 00:07:02.689
Master? You mean there are
other sorcerers in this town?

00:07:03.723 --> 00:07:06.927
Hey! I said hey!

00:07:07.494 --> 00:07:10.130
You could at least show me around!

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:11.264
Orphen!

00:07:11.665 --> 00:07:13.500
I've been telling you that I don't have the time!

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:17.604
What? Your partner is begging
and you still can't?

00:07:17.604 --> 00:07:22.309
A partnership is where people
cooperate to accomplish a goal.

00:07:22.309 --> 00:07:24.811
That kind of responsible person is a partner.

00:07:25.045 --> 00:07:29.849
So, let's cooperate on having a fun tour!

00:07:29.849 --> 00:07:32.085
That's not cooperation! That's being selfish.

00:07:32.085 --> 00:07:33.753
Who's selfish?! Who?!

00:07:33.753 --> 00:07:35.622
Go look in a mirror and you'll meet her.

00:07:36.389 --> 00:07:38.725
Wh-what did you say?!

00:07:48.301 --> 00:07:49.803
Wh-what is that?

00:07:49.803 --> 00:07:50.971
A golem!

00:07:50.971 --> 00:07:52.372
What? A golem?

00:07:52.372 --> 00:07:55.308
A weapon made of stone
by the Heavenly Beings.

00:07:55.308 --> 00:07:57.544
You see them often scattered around ruins.

00:07:57.544 --> 00:08:00.013
This is the first time I've seen a moving one.

00:08:00.013 --> 00:08:01.081
You're
noisy!

00:08:01.081 --> 00:08:02.949
What do you mean noisy?!

00:08:02.949 --> 00:08:05.218
Just when I made a cool entrance for you!

00:08:05.218 --> 00:08:08.822
Don't you have enough manners to
greet someone at the right moment,

00:08:08.822 --> 00:08:10.423
you black-bellied sorcerer?!

00:08:10.423 --> 00:08:13.226
| don't think that it was
such a cool entrance though.

00:08:14.894 --> 00:08:18.398
Geez, where'd they find
something like that?

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.005
Sorcerous runes?

00:08:25.005 --> 00:08:27.507
This isn't something they could handle.

00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:28.641
Then who?

00:08:28.975 --> 00:08:32.278
For all the numerous insults you've
paid to me, the stupendous Volcan,

00:08:32.278 --> 00:08:34.981
| will cudgel you with the hand of justice!

00:08:34.981 --> 00:08:37.784
Go, Golem Number 1! Polkano Punch!

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:46.359
Cleao!

00:08:46.826 --> 00:08:49.729
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:08:53.033 --> 00:08:54.634
Big Brother!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.184
Here...

00:09:14.988 --> 00:09:16.256
Master!

00:09:17.757 --> 00:09:18.925
Majic!

00:09:24.097 --> 00:09:25.265
Orphen...

00:09:26.933 --> 00:09:28.201
Stephanie...

00:09:34.641 --> 00:09:35.809
It's been a while.

00:09:36.509 --> 00:09:38.578
You haven't changed, Orphen.

00:09:54.994 --> 00:09:57.664
Now that's good, back to your cute face.

00:09:58.298 --> 00:09:59.666
Th-thanks.

00:10:01.167 --> 00:10:04.838
Miss Stephanie was your partner, Master?

00:10:04.838 --> 00:10:07.440
Yeah, that was two years ago.

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:09.909
We worked together for a while.

00:10:09.909 --> 00:10:12.545
We crossed some
pretty dangerous bridges too.

00:10:12.545 --> 00:10:13.880
Right, Stephanie?

00:10:14.647 --> 00:10:16.349
You act like such a stranger!

00:10:16.349 --> 00:10:18.918
Call me Steph, just like before.

00:10:25.191 --> 00:10:26.493
Are you hurt?

00:10:27.694 --> 00:10:28.795
That healeth...

00:10:28.795 --> 00:10:29.896
It's all right.

00:10:29.896 --> 00:10:31.798
It's all right the way it is.

00:10:32.031 --> 00:10:35.034
Back then you could have healed it yourself.

00:10:35.902 --> 00:10:37.370
Miss Stephanie is...

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.172
A former sorcerer.

00:10:39.172 --> 00:10:42.242
A long time ago during an experiment
| was seriously injured,

00:10:42.242 --> 00:10:45.678
and since then my magical powers
have completely disappeared.

00:10:46.079 --> 00:10:48.781
Is that so? I'm sorry.

00:10:48.781 --> 00:10:51.084
That's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:11:10.003 --> 00:11:11.471
Hop! Step! Skip!

00:11:11.771 --> 00:11:14.307
Oh! Welcome home, Stephanie!

00:11:14.307 --> 00:11:16.543
Guests? So many!

00:11:16.543 --> 00:11:19.612
That's right, precious friends
and a tear-filled reunion.

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:22.282
I'll introduce you later, okay?

00:11:22.282 --> 00:11:24.217
Hey there, Steph! Guests?

00:11:24.217 --> 00:11:25.618
That's good timing.

00:11:25.618 --> 00:11:27.820
My home country just sent me
a heap of apples.

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.255
Take some with you later.

00:11:29.255 --> 00:11:31.291
Thank you as always, Auntie!

00:11:31.925 --> 00:11:33.826
This place doesn't change.

00:11:33.826 --> 00:11:34.827
Yes.

00:11:42.101 --> 00:11:43.836
Well, let's go.

00:11:54.113 --> 00:11:56.316
Survey of the Heavenly Beings' ruins?

00:11:56.316 --> 00:11:59.953
Yeah, Stephanie's an ancient magic
research specialist.

00:11:59.953 --> 00:12:02.956
She undertook the deciphering
of sorcerous runes.

00:12:02.956 --> 00:12:06.159
| see. If you study these ruins,

00:12:06.159 --> 00:12:10.296
then you might learn something
about the Sword of Baltanders.

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:14.500
Sorry, Orphen. I still haven't
been able to decipher them.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:18.037
I'd like more time to study the ruins.

00:12:18.037 --> 00:12:21.674
That's fine. I'm the one who returned
earlier than we agreed on.

00:12:21.674 --> 00:12:25.411
So then, why don't we go and investigate?

00:12:27.347 --> 00:12:29.182
Us? Investigate?

00:12:29.182 --> 00:12:31.384
You just want to play tourist, right?

00:12:31.384 --> 00:12:35.421
It's faster that way, right?
Then, let's do it. It's decided!

00:12:35.421 --> 00:12:37.724
Let's go to the ruins of
the Heavenly Beings right now!

00:12:37.724 --> 00:12:39.292
Wouldn't tomorrow be okay too?

00:12:39.726 --> 00:12:41.594
You don't have to hurry.

00:12:41.594 --> 00:12:43.396
Tomorrow I'll show you around.

00:12:46.499 --> 00:12:48.368
That's okay, isn't it, Miss Partner?

00:12:48.368 --> 00:12:49.702
Whatever you say.

00:12:49.702 --> 00:12:52.438
Who's her partner?

00:12:52.438 --> 00:12:55.608
These guys are just baggage! Baggage!

00:12:55.608 --> 00:12:58.611
That's true. After all, I'm an apprentice.

00:12:58.611 --> 00:13:01.381
Orphen, you!

00:13:01.381 --> 00:13:03.216
We have so much to catch up on.

00:13:03.216 --> 00:13:05.618
| won't let you sleep tonight, Orphen.

00:13:05.618 --> 00:13:08.288
Hey, hey! Be gentle!

00:13:08.288 --> 00:13:10.423
I'm tired from a long journey.

00:13:10.823 --> 00:13:12.525
Well, how about this?

00:13:12.525 --> 00:13:14.560
We haven't taken a bath together
for a long time.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:16.829
Quit it! We're not kids anymore.

00:13:17.397 --> 00:13:18.765
You're embarrassed!

00:13:18.765 --> 00:13:20.800
Speaking of baths, do you remember?

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:23.536
The hot springs of Haneko, you mean?
You really got me that time.

00:13:23.536 --> 00:13:29.142
Master, there's been a lot going on
while you were looking for Azalie.

00:13:29.142 --> 00:13:31.210
| feel misled.

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:38.584
Orphen, you filthy, slovenly,
promiscuous sorcerer!

00:13:41.621 --> 00:13:43.456
Thank you for the meal!

00:13:45.224 --> 00:13:47.894
Wow, Miss Stephanie, it's so good!

00:13:47.894 --> 00:13:49.796
It brings back memories!

00:13:49.796 --> 00:13:53.099
What? My cooking is pretty good too!

00:13:53.099 --> 00:13:55.001
This is good though.

00:13:55.001 --> 00:13:58.538
I'll give you the recipe later, Cleao.

00:13:58.538 --> 00:13:59.672
That's okay.

00:14:04.243 --> 00:14:05.745
It was a little bland for you, right?

00:14:05.745 --> 00:14:06.746
Thank you.

00:14:13.319 --> 00:14:14.587
Stupid...

00:14:33.306 --> 00:14:35.074
Magnificent! Magnificent!

00:14:35.074 --> 00:14:37.176
With this many megalithic armaments,

00:14:37.176 --> 00:14:40.847
there's nothing for wonderful me to fear!

00:14:42.215 --> 00:14:44.384
But you just lost.

00:14:44.384 --> 00:14:46.953
Dortin, when have I ever lost?

00:14:46.953 --> 00:14:51.057
Your megalithic armament was
blown to bits by one of Orphen's attacks!

00:14:51.057 --> 00:14:54.694
Ignorant one! That was a plan to make
the enemy underestimate me.

00:14:54.694 --> 00:14:55.795
Is that so?

00:14:56.095 --> 00:14:58.064
You evil, black-bellied sorcerer, you!

00:14:58.064 --> 00:15:02.235
This time I'll fix you so that
your seeds won't sprout!

00:15:02.235 --> 00:15:04.070
Was that the sorcerer you were talking about?

00:15:04.937 --> 00:15:08.608
Yes, it was! We took a loss when he
hit us with a disguised strike,

00:15:08.608 --> 00:15:11.377
but he is, after all, a loser sorcerer. Yes.

00:15:12.145 --> 00:15:16.149
It seems that he has more power than you think.

00:15:16.616 --> 00:15:18.217
That's fine.

00:15:18.217 --> 00:15:24.323
| shall verify his sorcerous power by using you.

00:15:24.657 --> 00:15:26.859
Verify his sorcerous power? You mean-

00:15:27.393 --> 00:15:29.929
Hey, Dortin, don't you know your manners?

00:15:29.929 --> 00:15:34.367
You're in front of the treasured guardian
who lent us these wondrous weapons.

00:15:35.735 --> 00:15:39.472
Orphen is a sorcerer beyond my expectations.

00:15:40.039 --> 00:15:43.342
| have only to wait until he sets foot on this earth.

00:15:44.043 --> 00:15:45.511
He's late.

00:15:45.511 --> 00:15:49.816
It couldn't be that they've forgotten
their contract with me?

00:15:58.758 --> 00:16:01.694
She went out of her way just to buy us dessert!

00:16:01.694 --> 00:16:04.764
What a truly wonderful person Miss Stephanie is.

00:16:04.997 --> 00:16:05.431
What is written in here?

00:16:05.431 --> 00:16:07.500
She's kind, smart, and pretty.
What is written in here?

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:08.734
She's kind, smart, and pretty.

00:16:09.235 --> 00:16:13.139
I'm envious of you, Master, that you
had a person like her for a part-

00:16:13.806 --> 00:16:17.210
He has a cute partner now too! Right here!

00:16:17.643 --> 00:16:22.281
It's not nice to say, but she's been
studying the ruins all this time, right?

00:16:22.281 --> 00:16:25.885
And she can't find anything.
Can you call that a good partner?

00:16:25.885 --> 00:16:27.453
Well, there's no helping that!

00:16:27.453 --> 00:16:30.256
There are too many ruins
for her to study carefully,

00:16:30.256 --> 00:16:31.858
so it's only logical that it takes time-

00:16:33.793 --> 00:16:36.162
Then, I'll study them for him.

00:16:36.162 --> 00:16:39.365
Because cooperating is what partners do, right?

00:16:39.365 --> 00:16:40.933
Right, Orphen?

00:16:41.167 --> 00:16:42.969
Partner, you say?

00:16:42.969 --> 00:16:45.671
When you're always causing me trouble.

00:16:46.806 --> 00:16:48.241
Trouble, you say?

00:16:51.377 --> 00:16:53.513
What? You have a complaint?

00:16:55.948 --> 00:16:57.316
Master!

00:16:57.316 --> 00:16:59.986
Just when did I cause you trouble?

00:16:59.986 --> 00:17:02.355
You can't do anything without me!

00:17:02.355 --> 00:17:03.656
What?

00:17:05.358 --> 00:17:07.293
The two of us are over, aren't we?

00:17:07.293 --> 00:17:09.128
Don't say it like there was something!

00:17:10.663 --> 00:17:14.867
It'll be too late when you come crying,
begging for me to be your partner!

00:17:15.368 --> 00:17:16.936
Hey, Cleao!

00:17:16.936 --> 00:17:17.970
Goodbye!

00:17:20.373 --> 00:17:21.674
Master!

00:17:21.674 --> 00:17:24.844
Let it be. She'll come home when she cools off.

00:17:24.844 --> 00:17:27.113
No, not that, but...

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:30.316
Are we supposed to clean this up?

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.618
We?

00:17:33.419 --> 00:17:35.821
Just me.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.001
What should I do?

00:17:51.237 --> 00:17:52.638
Orphen...

00:18:12.491 --> 00:18:13.759
Cleao...

00:18:15.528 --> 00:18:19.899
Master, Cleao's stuff isn't here.

00:18:19.899 --> 00:18:21.834
What? That idiot.

00:18:33.713 --> 00:18:35.915
Okay, first here.

00:18:40.353 --> 00:18:42.521
So these are the ruins of the Heavenly Beings?

00:18:42.521 --> 00:18:45.491
| see. There does seem to be
some kind of secret.

00:18:57.269 --> 00:18:59.338
Just watch, Orphen!

00:18:59.338 --> 00:19:02.541
I'll make you realize that I'm a helpful partner!

00:19:02.541 --> 00:19:03.643
Don't!

